<title>USA: Newell completes acquisition from Cooper.</title>
<headline>Newell completes acquisition from Cooper.</headline>
<dateline>FREEPORT, Ill. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newell Co and Cooper Industries Inc said Friday they have completed Newell's acquisition of Cooper's Kirsch drapery hardware and window coverings business unit.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Kirsch, located in Sturgis, Michigan, has eight North American manufacturing facilities and five overseas facilities, and employs more than 2,400 people, the companies said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
